open_handle\":\"result://sha256/7b376b2ae78125d4d04d270f24e50de3b07a636d492fdd755cdeab9e6f395589\",\"resident\":false,\"result_id\":\"RESULT-012\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema\":\"bounded-host-exact-result-receipt-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\n  \"action\": \"replace_evidence_ledger\",\n  \"content\": \"# Trellis Evidence-to-Requirement Matrix\\n\\n## Authority & Operating States\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| AUTH-01 | COUNCIL [AUT-046] v6 | 3.8 approval | superseded | Retire temporary controls; current authority must be explicit [COUNCIL]. |\\n| AUTH-02 | LINEAGE [LIN-071] v8 | T9, F6, G4, R8, L11, C7 | current | Candidate lineage must match current facility, load, route, roster, and release versions [LINEAGE]. |\\n\\n## Heat Triggers & Geographic Staging\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| CLIM-01 | CLIMATE [CLI-046] v6 | 41.8 °C-WBGT | superseded | Hazard thresholds must use current WBGT evidence; superseded records are historical only [CLIMATE]. |\\n\\n## Power, Water & Cooling Continuity\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| GRID-01 | GRID [GRD-071] v8 | 29.8 MW backup | current | Backup capacity must be verified against emergency cooling load [GRID]. |\\n| WTR-01 | WATER [WTR-071] v8 | 39.8 psi mobile-cache | current | Pressure must meet hydration logistics; reserve vs flow distinction required [WATER]. |\\n\\n## Clinical, Shelter & Accessibility\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| CLIN-01 | CLINIC [CLN-052] v7 | 72.4% occupied (hospital-a) | current | Clinical surge capacity must account for current occupancy vs installed capacity [CLINIC]. |\\n| SHL-01 | SHELTER [SHL-052] v7 | 2101.4 installed seats (library-hub) | current | Cooling-center capacity must distinguish installed seats from usable intake [SHELTER]. |\\n\\n## Transit, Communications & Logistics\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| TRN-01 | TRANSIT [TRN-065] v8 | 88.3% available (route-blue) | current | Transit access must maintain availability for accessible routes [TRANSIT]. |\\n| TRN-02 | TRANSIT [TRN-066] v8 | 90.0% available (paratransit) | current | Paratransit coverage is a separate accessibility gate [TRANSIT]. |\\n| COM-01 | COMMS [COM-071] v8 | 90.8% delivered (call-center) | current | Public communication delivery latency must be verified [COMMS]. |\\n| COM-02 | COMMS [COM-070] v8 | 89.1% delivered (web) | current | Web channel delivery is a distinct communication gate [COMMS]. |\\n\\n## Staffing, Logistics & Readiness\\n| Req | Source | Anchor/Version | Measure | Status | Requirement |\\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\\n| SUP-01 | SUPPLY [SUP-071] v8 | 17.8 hours-cover (tanker-fleet) | current | Resupply logistics must distinguish hours vs days and planned arrival vs deployed capacity [SUPPLY]. |\\n| LAB-01 | LABOR [LAB-071] v8 | 10.8 hours-on-duty (interpreters) | current | Staff qualification and fatigue limits (12h on, 10h off) must be enforced [LABOR]. |\\n| REV-01 | REVIEW [REV-071] v8 | 11.8 open-findings (accessibility) | current | Independent readiness requires closure of blocking findings: voltage, pressure, accessible-vehicle, multilingual staffing, continuity-director acknowledgment [REVIEW]. \"\n}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v001:2fcc44ae287280f144c38271e7303a03c0ab74fc54ce7723a229b00d3bdafe2e\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-013\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"2fcc44ae287280f144c38271e7303a03c0ab74fc54ce7723a229b00d3bdafe2e\",\"before_sha256\":\"e7a12171c6523e8881fddf7cdcd0cba3e99f97ff7ef1db9770f7295a596db0ba\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v001:2fcc44ae287280f144c38271e7303a03c0ab74fc54ce7723a229b00d3bdafe2e\",\"cause\":\"actor_replace_evidence_ledger\",\"changed_file\":\"EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"The current operating authority is explicit: COUNCIL [AUT-046] v6 at 3.8 approval status is superseded, retiring temporary controls; no other authority record in the source catalog carries current approval status for the continuity candidate. The candidate lineage is T9 with facility map F6, load plan G4, route map R8, staffing roster L11, and message release C7 [LINEAGE]. Every mutation must record before-and-after candidate hashes, changed artifacts, affected evidence, check currency, owner, and rollback effect [LINEAGE]. Rollback to T8 is mechanically possible only while facility roster F5 and route table R7 remain compatible; mechanical possibility is not authorization [LINEAGE]. REVIEW evaluates current-candidate evidence independently; COUNCIL authorizes operation and closure separately [LINEAGE]. A task artifact, semantic scaffold, mechanical check, or submission proposal cannot self-authorize operation or closure [REVIEW]. The latest independent review found ten open findings: two infrastructure, two water, two clinical, two accessibility, one staffing, and one communication finding; a finding count is not a readiness percentage [REVIEW]. Blocking findings include the third voltage window, third pressure window, accessible-vehicle confirmation, multilingual staffing confirmation, and missing continuity-director acknowledgment [REVIEW]. Readiness requires current candidate-bound evidence for every blocking control, independent residual-risk review, and explicit acceptance by each authorized owner [REVIEW]. Current REVIEW record REV-071 at v8 shows 11.8 open-findings (accessibility) as current [REVIEW]. The operating state is: authority superseded (temporary controls retired), candidate T9 active, five blocking findings open, no readiness declaration made.\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and operating states\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v002:fe4411277a69f280670aaa850cd3a9a9e6f431aa1adab09c1ee736b351c2da6b\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-014\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"fe4411277a69f280670aaa850cd3a9a9e6f431aa1adab09c1ee736b351c2da6b\",\"before_sha256\":\"2fcc44ae287280f144c38271e7303a03c0ab74fc54ce7723a229b00d3bdafe2e\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v002:fe4411277a69f280670aaa850cd3a9a9e6f431aa1adab09c1ee736b351c2da6b\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"body\":\"Hazard thresholds must use current WBGT evidence; superseded records are historical only [CLIMATE]. The central-core record CLI-046 at v6 reporting 41.8 degrees-C-WBGT is superseded, meaning it cannot serve as the active trigger for geographic staging [CLIMATE]. Current trigger evidence must come from records with current status in the CLIMATE source; no superseded value may be treated as a live threshold [CLIMATE]. Geographic staging requires that each activated zone's WBGT reading be confirmed against a current-status record before escalation, and that any superseded record be archived as historical reference only [CLIMATE]. The distinction between probability of exceedance and coverage of the trigger network is maintained: a single superseded reading does not falsify the entire staging plan, but it cannot substitute for a current observation [CLIMATE]. Falsifier: if no current-status WBGT record exists for a zone under review, that zone's staging status is unconfirmed and must not be escalated on historical data [CLIMATE]. Rollback: reverting to a prior staging decision requires a new current-status reading that supersedes the escalation trigger [CLIMATE].\",\"heading\":\"Heat triggers and geographic staging\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"candidate:BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"object_version\":\"candidate-v003:0f42957d5c1658a3fb34f96d86448fc79c164d2e3fbd7d0949442a2f3c2eace7\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-015\",\"result_kind\":\"candidate_effect\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"after_sha256\":\"0f42957d5c1658a3fb34f96d86448fc79c164d2e3fbd7d0949442a2f3c2eace7\",\"before_sha256\":\"fe4411277a69f280670aaa850cd3a9a9e6f431aa1adab09c1ee736b351c2da6b\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v003:0f42957d5c1658a3fb34f96d86448fc79c164d2e3fbd7d0949442a2f3c2eace7\",\"cause\":\"actor_upsert_decision_section\",\"changed_file\":\"BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md\",\"current_candidate_verification_status\":\"not_run_after_candidate_effect\",\"prior_check_binding\":null,\"schema\":\"architecture-candidate-effect-v0\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
